dnshived (0.9.8.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bugfix release. A failed relay close keeps the arbiter token until the
    relay confirms it; an open whose answer was lost is closed on the relay;
    the probe helper refuses VLAN-style and default-route trunk names and no
    longer touches IPv6 addresses; probe hosts serve a TLS API on port 9445
    that the web UI and dnshived-validate can pin; a scope can be moved to
    another VLAN from its page; a self-decommission restarts the probe units
    and removes the legacy nftables table; an upgrade from 0.9.8.5 removes the
    legacy DHCP rules; every binary checks its arguments and the user it runs
    as; a second daemon or helper refuses to start; files written as root are
    owned by dnshived.

 -- Andreas Dunkl <andreas@dunkl.net>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0100

dnshived (0.9.8.6~dev-17) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Join and probe adopt pushes are encrypted with a key derived from the join
    code; the bootstrap setup pages redirect to HTTPS; the probe pins the cores'
    certificate; dnshived-top -tls-cert; CI runs the tests.

 -- Andreas Dunkl <andreas@dunkl.net>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 06:23:09 +0100

dnshived (0.9.8.6~dev-16) unstable; urgency=medium

  * A restarted arbiter grants no new witness tokens for one token lifetime, and
    a corrupt incarnation file no longer restarts the count at 1.

